{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206860/extras/7b1942d80675cb50d276ed3687b17c84.avif?t=1758967132\" width=700 height=550 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VA:\u5922\u4e43\u3061\u304b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You used to be one of the most promising young officers in the base.<br>Until one day... you got reassigned to the <strong>Gummy Bear Containment &amp; Management Department</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Simple.<br>\u2014 Supervise a lazy-to-the-core, ridiculously squishy gummy bear (who claims she\u2019s a \u201cpacifist\u201d),<br>and make sure she produces <i>Star Dust</i>, the magical substance that keeps the entire base running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or else?<br>The base shuts down, and everyone\u2019s going back to their hometowns to sell canned fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her daily routine?<br>Wake up \u2192 Eat \u2192 Nap \u2192 Roll around \u2192 Lick her paw \u2192 Nap again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your daily routine?<br>Break down \u2192 Spit blood \u2192 Become the company\u2019s official clean-up crew.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Full Japanese Voice Acting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf6c Live2d-animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab <strong>Idle + Clicker Hybrid</strong><br>Choose whether she works or rests \u2014 Star Dust production depends on your patience and clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Hilarious Event Scenes</strong><br>She slacks off, she complains, she\u2019ll tell you, \u201cI\u2019m not a production machine, I\u2019m a cute mascot!\u201d while you try not to explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Hidden Comedy Skits</strong><br>From the infamous idiot sandwich moment to the legendary party-throwing boss \u2014 surprises await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f In-depth interactions with the cute Gummy Bear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Who is this game for?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 You love idle games but want to laugh your head off.<br>\u2705 You want the full \u201cprofessional clean-up crew\u201d experience.<br>\u2705 You have absolutely zero resistance to squishy, lazy, cute characters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3206860?t=1758967132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3206860?t=1758967132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206860/e5bdff62515b116c8293c3e360b06ffbe66e7119/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758967132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206860/e5bdff62515b116c8293c3e360b06ffbe66e7119/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758967132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Please note that this game contains the following sensitive elements:\r\nRevealing clothing, mild sexual references, and sexual animations"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206860/extras/7b1942d80675cb50d276ed3687b17c84.avif?t=1758967132\" width=700 height=550 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VA:\u5922\u4e43\u3061\u304b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You used to be one of the most promising young officers in the base.<br>Until one day... you got reassigned to the <strong>Gummy Bear Containment &amp; Management Department</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Simple.<br>\u2014 Supervise a lazy-to-the-core, ridiculously squishy gummy bear (who claims she\u2019s a \u201cpacifist\u201d),<br>and make sure she produces <i>Star Dust</i>, the magical substance that keeps the entire base running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or else?<br>The base shuts down, and everyone\u2019s going back to their hometowns to sell canned fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her daily routine?<br>Wake up \u2192 Eat \u2192 Nap \u2192 Roll around \u2192 Lick her paw \u2192 Nap again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your daily routine?<br>Break down \u2192 Spit blood \u2192 Become the company\u2019s official clean-up crew.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Full Japanese Voice Acting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf6c Live2d-animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab <strong>Idle + Clicker Hybrid</strong><br>Choose whether she works or rests \u2014 Star Dust production depends on your patience and clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Hilarious Event Scenes</strong><br>She slacks off, she complains, she\u2019ll tell you, \u201cI\u2019m not a production machine, I\u2019m a cute mascot!\u201d while you try not to explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Hidden Comedy Skits</strong><br>From the infamous idiot sandwich moment to the legendary party-throwing boss \u2014 surprises await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f In-depth interactions with the cute Gummy Bear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Who is this game for?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 You love idle games but want to laugh your head off.<br>\u2705 You want the full \u201cprofessional clean-up crew\u201d experience.<br>\u2705 You have absolutely zero resistance to squishy, lazy, cute characters.</p>","developers":["WeissGarden","Plumko","Atlas","The Thinker Cat"],"dlc":[3949390,3949400,3949370,3949380,3949360,3948010],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.stea